<title>NORWAY: Helicopter Services Group orders four aircraft from Eurocopter.</title>
<headline>Helicopter Services Group orders four aircraft from Eurocopter.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Helicopter Services Group said on Thursday it had ordered four AS 365N4 Dauphin helicopters from Franco-German venture Eurocopter for delivery between November 1998 and September 1999.</p>
<p>The contract is worth 120 million francs ($20.5 million), the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Helicopter Services, whose business includes offshore platform shuttle traffic, said it had signed options on further deliveries of the new helicopter type in the years 2000-2002.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41 ($ = 5.841 French Francs)</p>
